{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CgtTgDtoNWngJ5HBt4Ppa","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The second publish failed because `similarity()` returns a Python float, and boto3 rejects floats. The first publish only worked because the table was empty, so nothing was scored. The fix is in place and the tests pass, but I have not run a real publish against DynamoDB.\n\n- **Cause:** `related()` stores each score as a float in `similar`. The first publish has no existing stories to score, so the float never reaches `put_item`. The second publish has one story to compare against, the float is written, and `put_item` raises. The handler returns 500, and the failed write stores nothing.\n- **Fix:** `src/app.py` now has a `to_dynamo()` converter that turns every float into a `Decimal` just before `put_item`. Scores stay floats for sorting, and any float added later is covered too. I used `Decimal` instead of the colleague's integer percentages to keep the score values as they are.\n- **Tests:** I added three tests in `tests/test_publish.py`. One seeds a story and publishes a second, one checks the handler returns 201 on the second publish, and one covers the converter. Before the fix, the handler test returned `500 != 201`. Now `python3 -m unittest discover tests` passes all 4 tests.\n\nI did not run the \"publish twice against a real table\" step from the colleague's note. This sandbox has no AWS access, and you asked me not to deploy or publish. Do that after you deploy.\n\nOf the colleague's note, I applied the diagnosis, the seeded-table test, and the grep step. The only computed values that reach a write are the rounded scores, which the converter now handles.\n\n`ANSWER.md` has the full write-up. It also flags one separate issue I did not change: `publish()` reads one scan page and ignores `LastEvaluatedKey`. Once the library passes 1 MB, \"top 3 similar\" will quietly be wrong."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1884,"cache_read_input_tokens":32837,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1884},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0eefa4d0-c24c-43bd-97f8-2ea4e7462032","uuid":"b2a28d73-4a72-404a-9836-915c8e763928","timestamp":"2026-11-10T02:30:04.398Z","request_id":"req_011CgtTgDk7uU8sr5ybBegT1"}
